The Dawn engine is an engine built to drain the power of a [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]] and put it to work. [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]] designed it and gave it his name, and the [[Org/Althane/The Weft|Weft]] built a full one in the city on the blood lake of the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/index|Gulch]]. It runs on the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessian]] Beast whose corpse lies on the ziggurat there.

The [[Geography/Althane/Brejvasing/index|Brejvasen]] had long drawn the Beast's power off to feed [[Geography/Althane/The Thirteenth Realm|the Thirteenth Realm]]; the engine instead keeps that power at home. Dawnmonger left the plans for the engine with [[People/Althane/Marzo|Marzo]], and a later version is the power source of [[Org/Althane/X-Dive|X-Dive]].
